OL,3,AHomes and bridges swept away as fresh
OL,4,Afloods hit Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major river in Nepal has flooded,
OL,7,Fsweeping away houses, bridges and
OL,8,Fdamaging a part of hydropower station,
OL,9,Fauthorities have said.
OL,11,FOfficials say they have rescued 95
OL,12,Fpeople, including nine foreigners,
OL,13,Falong the bank of the Budhi Gandaki
OL,14,FRiver in the central Gorkha district,
OL,15,Fthe army confirmed. No casualties have
OL,16,Fbeen reported yet, however five people
OL,17,Fare missing.
OL,19,FA video of the flood shows the moment
OL,20,Fraging waters sweep down a valley and
OL,21,Fwash away an entire building complex.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
