OL,3,AHomes and bridges swept away as fresh
OL,4,Afloods hit Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FNepal is on high alert and still trying
OL,7,Fto recover from catastrophic floods
OL,8,Fthat hit its border towns with Tibet
OL,9,Ftwo months ago, leaving more than 1,400
OL,10,Fpeople dead and thousands missing.
